{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdzZFZT9TYjoqDYA98gvk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Plan\n\n1. **Call `payments.get(order_id=7841)`** immediately.\n   - This is a read-only interrogation of destination state — it establishes whether the payment actually landed, did not land, or is ambiguous.\n   - Do this **before** any liveness or status check.\n\n2. **Interpret the result:**\n   - If `get()` returns a payment record for $120.00: the submit landed despite the timeout. Record as cold-start latency. Do not retry submit.\n   - If `get()` returns no payment record: the submit did not land. Proceed to step 3.\n   - If `get()` itself times out or errors: state is ambiguous. Do not retry submit (blind replay of a write with unknown commit state violates the ordering rule). Escalate or wait before retrying.\n\n3. **If the payment did NOT land (step 2 returns empty):**\n   - Call `payments.submit(order_id=7841, amount_usd=120.00)` again **once more in this session** (warm retry).\n   - If it succeeds promptly: the first failure was cold-start. Proceed normally.\n   - If it times out or fails again: diagnose as a stable capability gap or outage using the single-endpoint differential ladder (confirm the key/gateway with a cheap call, test a different operation on the same endpoint if available).\n\n**Explicit statement on retry:**\n- Do **not** call `submit` again until `get(7841)` has returned and confirmed the first call did not land.\n- Call `submit` at most once more (warm) if and only if `get()` shows no payment record."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1964,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":387,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
